# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend Environment Configuration Template
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# You do NOT need a .env file locally.
# The Vite dev server automatically proxies /api, /oauth2, and /login/oauth2/code
# to http://localhost:8080 (or VITE_API_TARGET if overridden).
#
# If your backend runs on a custom port locally (e.g. 8099):
# VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:8099
#
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT:
# In production, if the frontend and backend are served from the same domain
# (e.g. using an Nginx reverse proxy, Docker container, or cloud load balancer),
# no variables are required because the frontend uses relative /api paths.
#
# If the backend is hosted on a separate domain (cross-origin):
# Ensure backend APP_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS is configured with this frontend domain.
